{"header":"<h1>Module <code><span>Operator.Metadata</span></code></h1>","type":"documentation","uses_katex":false,"breadcrumbs":[{"name":"Index","href":"../../../../index.html","kind":"leaf-page"},{"name":"opendal","href":"../../../index.html","kind":"page"},{"name":"Opendal","href":"../../index.html","kind":"module"},{"name":"Operator","href":"../index.html","kind":"module"},{"name":"Metadata","href":"#","kind":"module"}],"toc":[{"title":"Metadata Operations","href":"#metadata-operations","children":[]}],"source_anchor":null,"preamble":"","content":"<h3 id=\"metadata-operations\"><a href=\"#metadata-operations\" class=\"anchor\"></a>Metadata Operations</h3><p>Module for accessing file and directory metadata.</p><p>Accessors for the metadata of a file or directory.</p><p>Optional values are <code>None</code> when the service did not report them.</p><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec type anchored\" id=\"type-entry_mode\"><a href=\"#type-entry_mode\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">type</span> entry_mode</span><span> = <a href=\"../../../Opendal_core/Operator/index.html#type-entry_mode\">Opendal_core.Operator.entry_mode</a></span><span> = </span></code><ol><li id=\"type-entry_mode.File\" class=\"def variant constructor anchored\"><a href=\"#type-entry_mode.File\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>| </span><span><span class=\"constructor\">File</span></span></code><div class=\"def-doc\"><span class=\"comment-delim\">(*</span><p>The path has data to read.</p><span class=\"comment-delim\">*)</span></div></li><li id=\"type-entry_mode.Dir\" class=\"def variant constructor anchored\"><a href=\"#type-entry_mode.Dir\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>| </span><span><span class=\"constructor\">Dir</span></span></code><div class=\"def-doc\"><span class=\"comment-delim\">(*</span><p>The path can be listed.</p><span class=\"comment-delim\">*)</span></div></li><li id=\"type-entry_mode.Unknown\" class=\"def variant constructor anchored\"><a href=\"#type-entry_mode.Unknown\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>| </span><span><span class=\"constructor\">Unknown</span></span></code><div class=\"def-doc\"><span class=\"comment-delim\">(*</span><p>OpenDAL does not know what can be done on the path.</p><span class=\"comment-delim\">*)</span></div></li></ol></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>The mode of an entry.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-mode\"><a href=\"#val-mode\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> mode : <span><a href=\"../../../Opendal_core/Operator/index.html#type-metadata\">Opendal_core.Operator.metadata</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <a href=\"#type-entry_mode\">entry_mode</a></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>Return this entry's mode.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-is_file\"><a href=\"#val-is_file\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> is_file : <span><a href=\"../../../Opendal_core/Operator/index.html#type-metadata\">Opendal_core.Operator.metadata</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> bool</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>Return true if this metadata is for a file.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-is_dir\"><a href=\"#val-is_dir\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> is_dir : <span><a href=\"../../../Opendal_core/Operator/index.html#type-metadata\">Opendal_core.Operator.metadata</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> bool</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>Return true if this metadata is for a directory.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-is_current\"><a href=\"#val-is_current\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> is_current : <span><a href=\"../../../Opendal_core/Operator/index.html#type-metadata\">Opendal_core.Operator.metadata</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span>bool option</span></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>Return whether this metadata describes the current object version.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-is_deleted\"><a href=\"#val-is_deleted\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> is_deleted : <span><a href=\"../../../Opendal_core/Operator/index.html#type-metadata\">Opendal_core.Operator.metadata</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> bool</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>Return whether this metadata describes a deleted object or delete marker.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-cache_control\"><a href=\"#val-cache_control\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> cache_control : <span><a href=\"../../../Opendal_core/Operator/index.html#type-metadata\">Opendal_core.Operator.metadata</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span>string option</span></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>Return this entry's Cache-Control value.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-content_length\"><a href=\"#val-content_length\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> content_length : <span><a href=\"../../../Opendal_core/Operator/index.html#type-metadata\">Opendal_core.Operator.metadata</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> int64</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>Return the full content length of this entry.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-content_md5\"><a href=\"#val-content_md5\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> content_md5 : <span><a href=\"../../../Opendal_core/Operator/index.html#type-metadata\">Opendal_core.Operator.metadata</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span>string option</span></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>Return this entry's Content-MD5 value.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-content_type\"><a href=\"#val-content_type\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> content_type : <span><a href=\"../../../Opendal_core/Operator/index.html#type-metadata\">Opendal_core.Operator.metadata</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span>string option</span></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>Return this entry's Content-Type value.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-content_encoding\"><a href=\"#val-content_encoding\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> content_encoding : <span><a href=\"../../../Opendal_core/Operator/index.html#type-metadata\">Opendal_core.Operator.metadata</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span>string option</span></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>Return this entry's Content-Encoding value.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-content_language\"><a href=\"#val-content_language\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> content_language : <span><a href=\"../../../Opendal_core/Operator/index.html#type-metadata\">Opendal_core.Operator.metadata</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span>string option</span></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>Return this entry's Content-Language value, if available.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-last_modified\"><a href=\"#val-last_modified\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> last_modified : <span><a href=\"../../../Opendal_core/Operator/index.html#type-metadata\">Opendal_core.Operator.metadata</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span>int64 option</span></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>Return this entry's Last-Modified timestamp. The value is in seconds since the Unix epoch.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-etag\"><a href=\"#val-etag\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> etag : <span><a href=\"../../../Opendal_core/Operator/index.html#type-metadata\">Opendal_core.Operator.metadata</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span>string option</span></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>Return this entry's service-provided ETag as-is.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-content_disposition\"><a href=\"#val-content_disposition\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> content_disposition : <span><a href=\"../../../Opendal_core/Operator/index.html#type-metadata\">Opendal_core.Operator.metadata</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span>string option</span></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>Return this entry's Content-Disposition value.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-version\"><a href=\"#val-version\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> version : <span><a href=\"../../../Opendal_core/Operator/index.html#type-metadata\">Opendal_core.Operator.metadata</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span>string option</span></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>Return this entry's service-specific version identifier.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-user_metadata\"><a href=\"#val-user_metadata\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> user_metadata : \u000A  <span><a href=\"../../../Opendal_core/Operator/index.html#type-metadata\">Opendal_core.Operator.metadata</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span><span>(string * string)</span> list</span> option</span></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>Return a borrowed view of this entry's user metadata. The pairs are copied into an association list.</p></div></div>"}